===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*preh₂-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|first}}, {{m|enm|furst}}, {{m|enm|ferst}}, {{m|enm|fyrst}}, from {{inh|en|ang|fyrest}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*furist}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*furistaz||foremost, first}}, superlative of {{der|en|gem-pro|*fur}}, {{m|gem-pro|*fura}}, {{m|gem-pro|*furi||before}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*per-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*pero-||forward, beyond, around}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|fore|est|nocat=1}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|frr|foarste||first}}, {{cog|nl|voorste||foremost, first}}, {{cog|de|Fürst||chief, prince|lit=first (born)}}, {{cog|sv|först||first}}, {{cog|nn|fyrst||first}}, {{cog|is|fyrstur||first}}.

Other cognates include {{cog|sa|पूर्व||first}} and {{cog|ru|первый}}.

